go-augeas-original contrib lenses
==================================

The `.aug` files in this directory are **original lenses authored for
go-augeas**. They are NOT part of the upstream Augeas distribution and must
not be confused with the verbatim upstream mirror under `lenses/dist/`.

They cover configuration formats that upstream Augeas 1.14.1 does not yet
ship a lens for:

    Wireguard  (lens Wireguard.lns)  WireGuard tunnels: /etc/wireguard/*.conf
    Rclone     (lens Rclone.lns)     rclone remotes:    rclone.conf

Each lens carries inline `test ... get ... =` / `test ... put ... after =`
assertions that are run in CI (see internal/interp TestContribCorpus), exactly
like the upstream corpus is gated on its own `test` assertions by TestCorpus.
Their `Util`/`IniFile`/`Sep`/`Rx` imports resolve from the upstream
`lenses/dist/` corpus.

